    "disclosures": [
      {
        "id": "d01",
        "from": 1,
        "to": 1,
        "text": "第3章标题为《蹲点是反派的必备技能》。",
        "channel": "author",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d02",
        "from": 2,
        "to": 2,
        "text": "作者严正声明：本书出场角色均已满18岁，不存在未成年人。",
        "channel": "author",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d04",
        "from": 4,
        "to": 4,
        "text": "有问题：反派为什么要去找茬魔法少女。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d05",
        "from": 5,
        "to": 5,
        "text": "苏天晴从厨房端着牛奶和吐司走到餐桌坐下，一边刷原主人的裂屏手机，一边思考反派为什么要找魔法少女的茬。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d06",
        "from": 5,
        "to": 5,
        "text": "苏天晴思考这个永恒的问题。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_magical_girls"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d07",
        "from": 6,
        "to": 6,
        "text": "苏天晴想反派的目标可能是毁灭世界、统治人类，或者更高远的目标。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_villain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d08",
        "from": 7,
        "to": 7,
        "text": "苏天晴没有毁灭世界或统治人类等想法，这个世界也没有正式的反派组织，目标定得太高远肯定出问题。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "denial",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_villain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d09",
        "from": 8,
        "to": 8,
        "text": "通过网络与身体原主人苏天晴小姐的记忆，苏天晴已大致了解这个世界的状况。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su_original"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d10",
        "from": 9,
        "to": 9,
        "text": "魔法少女与怪人怪兽是客观存在的。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_magical_girls"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d11",
        "from": 10,
        "to": 10,
        "text": "魔法少女们接受英雄协会的管辖委派，一边与怪人战斗一边作为偶像出镜；真实身份保密，但变身样子广为人知，与怪人怪兽的战斗成了另类宣传方式。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_magical_girls",
          "r_monsters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d12",
        "from": 11,
        "to": 11,
        "text": "苏天晴所在的蓉城目前正好有一名活跃的魔法少女。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_magical_girls"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d13",
        "from": 13,
        "to": 13,
        "text": "苏天晴咬一口抹了劣质果酱的吐司面包，点开视频网站上有关这名魔法少女的介绍视频。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_magical_girls"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d14",
        "from": 14,
        "to": 14,
        "text": "苏天晴认为知己知彼，想要当反派去故意找茬，必须提前了解对手。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_villain",
          "r_magical_girls"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d15",
        "from": 15,
        "to": 15,
        "text": "视频画面中天蓝色的少女与凶猛怪兽在街心交战，攻击招招到肉，苏天晴心中一紧，低头看自己白皙娇嫩的手腕。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_monsters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d16",
        "from": 16,
        "to": 16,
        "text": "苏天晴呢喃念出她的代号“风信子”。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d17",
        "from": 17,
        "to": 17,
        "text": "苏天晴想：她能变出大剑砍掉怪兽的脑袋，自己去跟这种肉搏型魔法少女找茬？真的假的？",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_monsters",
          "r_magical_girls"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d18",
        "from": 18,
        "to": 18,
        "text": "苏天晴对自己变身后的力量没有直观感受，但看自己细皮嫩肉的萝莉造型，绝对不是能跟人贴身肉搏的模样。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d19",
        "from": 19,
        "to": 19,
        "text": "苏天晴感叹没有丁点头绪。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d20",
        "from": 20,
        "to": 20,
        "text": "苏天晴放下手机，吃完最后一块面包和牛奶，擦嘴，走到沙发边，再次捧起那本厚重的古书。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_phone"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d21",
        "from": 21,
        "to": 21,
        "text": "这本书自我介绍为《墨丘利秘典》。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d22",
        "from": 22,
        "to": 22,
        "text": "苏天晴不知道它为什么突然就不会说话了，但认为里面或许会有自己需要的情报。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_codex"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d23",
        "from": 23,
        "to": 23,
        "text": "苏天晴将古书翻到第二页，几行文字从书页间浮现在狐狐眼前。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_codex"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d24",
        "from": 24,
        "to": 26,
        "text": "书页显示任务“夙愿”：获得200名关注者；成为闪耀的魔法少女，让所有人记住你的名字，带着她的那份一起活下去。",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_codex",
        "about": [
          "r_task_quest",
          "r_followers",
          "r_magical_girls"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d25",
        "from": 27,
        "to": 27,
        "text": "任务奖励为500神典石。",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_codex",
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d26",
        "from": 28,
        "to": 28,
        "text": "苏天晴觉得任务说明比黑洞还沉重，吐槽像是隔壁mygo片场来的。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_task_quest"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d27",
        "from": 29,
        "to": 29,
        "text": "苏天晴心里念叨任务说明，目光落到第三页上。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_task_quest",
          "r_codex"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d28",
        "from": 30,
        "to": 30,
        "text": "苏天晴心想“有了！”。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d29",
        "from": 31,
        "to": 33,
        "text": "书页介绍魔法少女风信子：新近活跃，擅长近战压制与肉搏，对魔法尚不熟练；并预测今晚蓉城市绿心公园将出现怪人，风信子将前往迎击。",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_codex",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_magical_girls",
          "r_rongcheng",
          "r_monsters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d30",
        "from": 34,
        "to": 34,
        "text": "苏天晴觉得情报正好来了。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d31",
        "from": 35,
        "to": 35,
        "text": "苏天晴合上古书，立刻开始筹划今天的行程。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_codex"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d32",
        "from": 36,
        "to": 36,
        "text": "苏天晴住在蓉城东部，绿心公园在中心城区，坐地铁要花两小时，提前去蹲点守候是最好的办法。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_rongcheng",
          "r_green_park",
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d33",
        "from": 37,
        "to": 37,
        "text": "苏天晴报名的蓉城医学院后天才开学，她有的是时间跟风信子耗。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d34",
        "from": 38,
        "to": 38,
        "text": "苏天晴甩掉睡衣，套上简朴裙装，坐在落地镜前整理头发与毛茸茸耳朵，感受尾巴触感，欣赏镜中娇小人影。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d35",
        "from": 39,
        "to": 39,
        "text": "原本的苏天晴不是有钱人家，作为狐狐也没什么打工挣钱本事，平时在网上写小说挣饭钱，衣柜单薄但仍有不少亮眼搭配，可爱萝莉穿什么都可爱。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su_original",
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d36",
        "from": 40,
        "to": 40,
        "text": "苏天晴自称爷真是世界第一可爱。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d37",
        "from": 41,
        "to": 41,
        "text": "小狐狸双手叉腰，嘴角扬起满意笑容。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d38",
        "from": 43,
        "to": 43,
        "text": "地铁并不很拥挤。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_metro"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d39",
        "from": 44,
        "to": 44,
        "text": "苏天晴将十字星与古书塞进挎包，找角落位置坐下，无视旁人目光，摸出手机继续查阅风信子相关消息。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_codex",
          "r_phone",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d40",
        "from": 45,
        "to": 45,
        "text": "兽人在蓉城并不少见，人们稍微多看一眼便见惯不怪。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_rongcheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d41",
        "from": 47,
        "to": 47,
        "text": "地铁播报：“叮咚。天府广场到了，换乘一号线的旅客请抓紧时间下车……”",
        "channel": "voice",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d42",
        "from": 48,
        "to": 48,
        "text": "地铁车程结束，苏天晴伸懒腰嘤咛，尾巴耳朵绷直。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d43",
        "from": 49,
        "to": 49,
        "text": "苏天晴觉得已经到市中心，两小时过得真快。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d44",
        "from": 50,
        "to": 50,
        "text": "狐狐提起挎包，循记忆路线离开地铁站，一边观察陌生又熟悉的世界，一边朝绿心公园走去。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_green_park",
          "r_metro"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d45",
        "from": 51,
        "to": 51,
        "text": "绿心公园是蓉城最大的湿地公园，人气很旺，周遭居民茶余饭后喜欢来转两圈，渐渐成为蓉城地标公园。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_green_park",
          "r_rongcheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d46",
        "from": 52,
        "to": 53,
        "text": "苏天晴置身绿意盎然的自然树林中，眯起眼睛畅快呼吸新鲜空气，感到愉快。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_green_park"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d47",
        "from": 54,
        "to": 54,
        "text": "苏天晴想接下来做点什么，刚过中午，包里有面包当晚饭，不如先看书。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_codex"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d48",
        "from": 55,
        "to": 55,
        "text": "苏天晴拉开挎包，将厚重黑色古书捧到手里，认真翻阅。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_codex"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d49",
        "from": 56,
        "to": 57,
        "text": "路过的人会惊讶看到别样风景：娇小小狐狸乖巧端坐长椅，树叶间阳光洒落，金色毛发光辉灿烂。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "description",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d50",
        "from": 58,
        "to": 58,
        "text": "苏天晴一边翻看墨丘利秘典，加上手机搜索到的消息，对这个世界与“自己”有了崭新认识。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_codex",
          "r_phone"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d51",
        "from": 59,
        "to": 59,
        "text": "曾经的苏天晴小姐虽然可爱，但社恐孤僻极少出门；坐两小时地铁到市中心已能算她半年来出过最远的远门。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su_original"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d52",
        "from": 60,
        "to": 60,
        "text": "来自兽人互助会的资助有限，她写小说功力不怎么样，靠全勤勉强混饭，成绩一塌糊涂。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su_original"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d53",
        "from": 61,
        "to": 61,
        "text": "苏天晴认为写小说死路一条。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su_original"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d54",
        "from": 62,
        "to": 62,
        "text": "看着银行账户里捉襟见肘的存款与学费贷款，狐狐深感痛心。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d55",
        "from": 63,
        "to": 63,
        "text": "小狐狸在心中暗自发誓：放心吧苏天晴小姐，既然我已经成为了你，那我就一定会让你过上更美好的生活。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "promise",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su_original"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d56",
        "from": 64,
        "to": 64,
        "text": "她的目光落到书页的任务上。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_codex",
          "r_task_quest"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d57",
        "from": 65,
        "to": 66,
        "text": "书页再次显示任务“夙愿”：获得200名关注者。",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_codex",
        "about": [
          "r_task_quest",
          "r_followers"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d58",
        "from": 67,
        "to": 67,
        "text": "苏天晴想关注者是不是粉丝；如果这是原身的夙愿，实现起来未免太简单。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_followers",
          "r_su_original"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d59",
        "from": 68,
        "to": 68,
        "text": "苏天晴认为以自己的颜值，随便自拍几张发到小蓝书就能随便混个千八百关注。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d60",
        "from": 69,
        "to": 70,
        "text": "苏天晴试着举起手机自拍，发出咔嚓声。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_phone"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d61",
        "from": 71,
        "to": 71,
        "text": "苏天晴发现前摄被摔坏了，暂时打消自拍想法。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_phone"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d62",
        "from": 73,
        "to": 73,
        "text": "苏天晴心中漫想未来，时间飞逝，日暮西山，夜幕迅速笼罩公园。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_green_park"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d63",
        "from": 75,
        "to": 75,
        "text": "苏天晴熄灭屏幕满是裂纹的大米手机，接上充电宝塞进挎包。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_phone"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d64",
        "from": 76,
        "to": 76,
        "text": "路上已有饭后出来悠哉闲逛的居民路人，许多带着孩子，欢声笑语让狐狐有点羡慕。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d65",
        "from": 77,
        "to": 78,
        "text": "苏天晴感慨无论前世还是现在，自己仍是孤身一人，惆怅后被强行压下。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d66",
        "from": 79,
        "to": 79,
        "text": "苏天晴觉得刷了一天视频有点累，该把注意力放到正事上。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d67",
        "from": 80,
        "to": 82,
        "text": "树林后传来尖锐吼叫，苏天晴耳朵猛地一抖；她望向远处，周围人慌乱逃跑，她本能紧张，尾巴炸毛粗了一圈。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d68",
        "from": 83,
        "to": 83,
        "text": "苏天晴想秘典上说的没错，今晚的确有怪人袭击绿心公园。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_codex",
          "r_monsters",
          "r_green_park"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d69",
        "from": 84,
        "to": 84,
        "text": "苏天晴自问：不对，我紧张什么，我不是反派吗，该紧张的应该是马上要到这边来的风信子。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_villain",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d70",
        "from": 85,
        "to": 85,
        "text": "小狐狸脸上扬起恶魔般的笑容。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d71",
        "from": 86,
        "to": 87,
        "text": "苏天晴对风信子说：快来吧，风信子；我可是给你准备了一份——美妙的见面礼哦。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "promise",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      }
    ],
